<title>USA: Reynolds and Reynolds raises shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Reynolds and Reynolds raises shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reynolds and Reynolds Co said Wednesday its board had more than doubled its share repurchase authorization, to about 3.5 million from 1.5 million.</p>
<p>It said it had bought back about two million shares through the third fiscal quarter ended June 30.</p>
<p>The company had a total of about 83 million Class A shares and common share equivalents outstanding at the end of the quarter.</p>
<p>A Reynolds and Reynolds official said the company had been buying back shares for years.</p>
<p>&quot;It's an on-going process,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>The company provides integrated information management systems and other services to automotive, health care and other sectors.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
